OL,3,AFarmer who called 999 saw 'large group
OL,4,Aof hooded and masked men' near RAF
OL,5,AFairford, she tells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe farmer says she called 999 at 01:36
OL,8,FBST. "Within 10 minutes the village was
OL,9,Ffull of armed police. I think it was
OL,10,Fpure luck that I arrived in the village
OL,11,Fat a similar time to the vans"
OL,13,FGloucestershire Police say they
OL,14,Freceived a call at about 00:45 BST on
OL,15,FSunday morning relating to "three
OL,16,Fsuspicious vehicles"
OL,18,FFive men were arrested and remain in
OL,19,Fcustody - they were arrested on
OL,20,Fsuspicion of committing offences under
OL,21,Fthe Explosives Act, and on suspicion of
OL,22,Fpreparing a terrorist act
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
