OL,3,AProtesters disperse after blocking
OL,4,Acontentious Orange Order parade
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland First Minister
OL,7,FMichelle O'Neill, who is also
OL,8,Fvice-president of Sinn Fein, joined the
OL,9,Fprotesters, while members of the Order
OL,10,Fand Democratic Unionist Party (DUP)
OL,11,Fpoliticians gathered about a mile away
OL,12,Fto wait for the road to clear.
OL,14,FMost of the protesters have since
OL,15,Fdispersed, but some members of the
OL,16,FOrder remain and intend to try and
OL,17,Fmarch.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
